From b4aebb3d98ecf4d7ec5a1bab34bb4aaf2e06ac97 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 05:10:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] C2-8/C2-9/CS-12: Karl the Fog (patchFog, time table, cloud
 bank, ?karl) and the night light field

Karl is a second, height-limited western fog term that patchFog adds to each
material's own shader (TOY family, GROUND, city water; THREE.ShaderChunk is
never touched), plus a sky band and a 40-cluster TOY_INST cloud bank that slides
between per-time layouts. The light field is one Points draw of about 13k street
lamps along far.lines plus the Golden Gate deck and tower lights; the GROUND
asphalt of lit streets gets a warm street glow from a lamp level baked into
aInfo. City mode drops the district's hand-hung clouds (CS-12).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017LP25KtXJb4YSph7iMzg8X
